  "text_md": "THE FACULTY OF SOCIAL SCIENCES of the University of the West Indies is pleased to be associated with the Institute of Caribbean Studies at the UWI Mona, in presenting the Conference on Caribbean Culture, in honour of distinguished Caribbean Scholar, Professor Rex Nettleford.\n\nThe conference will be opened on Sunday, March 3, 1996 by the Rt. Hon. Michael Manley, P.C., and closes with an address by the honoree on Wednesday, March 6, at 8 pm.\n\n# PROG RAMMEcDRAFT)\n\n# SUnday, March 3,\n\nOfficial opening by Rt. Hon. Michael Manley, P.C. 7 pm Venue: Phillip Sherlock Centre\n\n# Monday, March 4th\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>9am</th>\n    <th>Plenary Social</th>\n    <th>Social Science Lecture Theatre (SSLT)</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>10:00 am</td>\n    <td>Coffee Break</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>10:30. 12:30</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>12:30 · 2 pm</td>\n    <td>Lunch</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>2 · 3.30 pm</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>4-6 pm</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n# Tuesday March 5th.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>9am</th>\n    <th>Plenary Social</th>\n    <th>Science Lecture Theatre (SSLT)</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>10:00 am</td>\n    <td>Coffee Break</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>10:30 . 12:30</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>12:30 · 2 pm</td>\n    <td>Lunch</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>2 · 3.30 pm</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>4-6 pm</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th colspan=\"3\">Wednesday March 6th.</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>9 am</td>\n    <td>Plenary</td>\n    <td>Social Science Lecture Theatre (SSLT)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>10:00 am</td>\n    <td>Coffee Break</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>10:30 . 12:30</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>12:30-2 pm</td>\n    <td>Lunch</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>2 · 3.30 pm</td>\n    <td>Panels'</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>5:30pm</td>\n    <td>Panel</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>8 pm</td>\n    <td>Closing address Hon.</td>\n    <td>Rex Nettleford</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>Venue</td>\n    <td>Sherlock Centre</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n• Three panels will be running simultaneously.\n\n# PLEI'tARY SFEAKERS ll'ICWDE\n\nKamau Braithwaite Stuart Hall\n\n# CoiwEREI'!CE LAI'KlUAGE\n\nEnglish\n\n# EvEMNG PROGRAM\n\nPerformance by NDTC Cocktail Reception\n\nGeorge Lamming\n\n# 6 2\n\n# The Jamaica Pegasus\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Standard rooms (standard or double occupancy)</th>\n    <th>us$ 85.00</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Executive rooms (standard or double occupancy)</td>\n    <td>us $130.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Junior suites (standard or double occupancy)</td>\n    <td>US $175.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Edge Hill Luxury Apartments Studio units</td>\n    <td>us $175.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Mayfair Hotel</td>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Single Standard Room</td>\n    <td>US $51.25</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Single Superior Room</td>\n    <td>us $51.25</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Single Superior Room</td>\n    <td>us $61.25</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Bedroom Suite</td>\n    <td>US $88.76</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Double Superior Suite</td>\n    <td>US $125.00</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n# Senior Common Room. UWI Mona\n\n(Very limited accommodation, prices subject to change) $35.00\n\nSingle occupancy\n\nUS per night\n\nUS $50.00 per night\n\nDouble occupancy\n\n# Wyndham Kingston\n\nSingle/double occupancy\n\nAll prices include tax and service charges\n\nus $80.00\n\nConference attendees traveling from the U.S. via Air Jamaica are eligible for special fares. To inquire about these rates or make reservations, please advise your Air Jamaica representative to use record 'WCULTURE:'.\n\n",
